OL,3,GNEWSAGraffiti artists transform seaside
OL,4,Awall into mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of graffiti artists descended on a
OL,7,FNorfolk seaside town as part of a mural
OL,8,Fproject that had been 10 years in the
OL,9,Fmaking.
OL,11,FMore than 70 artists from across the UK
OL,12,Fand Europe visited Great Yarmouth on
OL,13,FSaturday to transform a 500m (546 yds)
OL,14,Fseafront wall behind the Pleasure
OL,15,FBeach.
OL,17,FThe event was organised by Reprezent
OL,18,FProject Community Interest Company
OL,19,F(CIC) which was set up in the town a
OL,20,Fdecade ago, and its chief executive
OL,21,FRuben Cruz said it had been his "dream"
OL,22,Fto hold this large mural jam.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
