OL,3,GNEWSAGraffiti artists transform seaside
OL,4,Awall into mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Nathan Murdoch, who came from
OL,7,FPeterborough, said he hoped the work
OL,8,Fwould show graffiti was more than what
OL,9,Fsome deemed as vandalism.
